#!RuleTest
#test CDISC-CG0027-A expect=noViolation domain=TI
#note "Distinct IECAT/IESCAT values on row 1 and an empty IESCAT on row 2 (the non-empty guard keeps an unpopulated subcategory silent) -> no violation."
#library standard=sdtmig version=3-4
#library dataset-class TI "TRIAL DESIGN"
dataset TI label="Trial Inclusion/Exclusion Criteria"
col STUDYID  type=Char label="Study Identifier"
col DOMAIN   type=Char label="Domain Abbreviation"
col IETESTCD type=Char label="Incl/Excl Criterion Short Name"
col IECAT    type=Char label="Inclusion/Exclusion Category"
col IESCAT   type=Char label="Inclusion/Exclusion Subcategory"
---
S1 | TI | INCL01 | INCLUSION | KEY INCLUSION
S1 | TI | EXCL01 | EXCLUSION |
